# HELD-OUT question set — SEALED. We never tune on this. The harness refuses to
# score it unless it still matches questions/heldout.seal (sha256), so our
# held-out numbers can be trusted not to be the product of overfitting.
# To change this set you must re-seal intentionally (python -m harness --seal),
# which is visible in git history. One JSON object per line.
